OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry, warm and sunny in the
OL,6,Fsouth with light winds. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickening in the north and west, with
OL,8,Fpatchy light rain possible at times.
OL,9,FFeeling warm where the sunshine
OL,10,Fdevelops.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying cloudy in the north
OL,13,Fand west with patchy drizzle possible
OL,14,Fwhere the cloud thickens. Clear spells
OL,15,Felsewhere with mist and fog patches
OL,16,Fpossible.
